Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 03:50:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 464/488] [DS4.1] The runner reads a None MTP override as none

DS4.1's VL model inherits get_mtp_target_hidden_states, which returns the
target's MTP buffer, None since 58a492841 removed it (the drafter takes
the auxiliary states and never read it). The runner sliced the result
unconditionally, so the profile run's dummy step failed and the serving
check's ports arm did not start. A None override now means none.
---
 tests/v1/worker/test_mtp_target_states.py | 31 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 vllm/v1/worker/gpu/model_runner.py        | 29 +++++++++++----------
 2 files changed, 47 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/v1/worker/test_mtp_target_states.py

diff --git a/tests/v1/worker/test_mtp_target_states.py b/tests/v1/worker/test_mtp_target_states.py
